refactor(scripts): probe uses 1 + N requests instead of one per token

One top-token probe, then a single greedy continuation per candidate
(new optional n_predict param on LlamaClient.continueText, default
still 8), cut client-side at the first sentence-ending word. Same
output shape, 6 requests instead of ~127 and ~4s instead of ~47s
against the local server. --max-words becomes --max-tokens (n_predict
per expansion, default 30).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
